# Flutter BLoC Project Context

- This is a Flutter codebase using Dart and BLoC/Cubit state management
- Read `ARCHITECTURE.md` before planning or implementing features
- Run tests after every change before considering work done (`flutter test`)
- Keep app, feature, core, and design system boundaries explicit
- Do not hardcode secrets or log sensitive data
- Add or update tests when behavior changes
